# MACH factory: cells, raw inbound payloads, archives and the local ticket queue stay local.
# Stations update tickets as they work; tracking them would leave the main checkout permanently modified.
# To share tickets with a team, set tickets.provider to a tracker in .factory/config.json.
.factory/tickets/
.factory/worktrees/
.factory/inbox/
.factory/archive/
.factory/tmp/
.factory/holdouts/
.factory/audit-report.json
.factory/observations/
# Machine-local Factory authorization (MACH Next). It must never travel by Git: a clone always starts disabled.
.factory/local/
# Product Studio drafts: a product manager's unpublished work stays on their machine.
.factory/studio/
# The Factory's intake ledger and event log: execution state, never shared by Git.
.factory/intake/
.factory/mach-backup-*/
# Python's cache, written when a MACH script runs.
.claude/skills/mach-*/scripts/__pycache__/
.factory/bin/__pycache__/
# The visual Product Studio's host program: built for one machine, fetched by the installer.
.factory/bin/mach-studio
